{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c6a33f21-dd70-4e2d-b22c-22c3092409bd","step":{"id":"s1","script":"The rectangle represents all possible outcomes. Circles A and B represent two events; their overlap contains outcomes belonging to both.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Union of two events"},{"op":"figure","id":"venn","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-3.4,3.4],"y":[-2.3,2.3],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"polyline","id":"space","points":[[-3.1,-2],[3.1,-2],[3.1,2],[-3.1,2]],"closed":true},{"kind":"circle","id":"event_a","center":[-0.9,0],"r":1.5},{"kind":"circle","id":"event_b","center":[0.9,0],"r":1.5},{"kind":"text","at":[-1.5,1],"text":"A"},{"kind":"text","at":[1.5,1],"text":"B"},{"kind":"text","at":[2.8,1.7],"text":"S"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c6a33f21-dd70-4e2d-b22c-22c3092409bd","step":{"id":"s2","script":"The union means A or B, including both. Shade everything inside either circle; leave outcomes outside both circles unshaded.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"union_shade","on":"venn","marks":[{"kind":"shade","inside":"event_a"},{"kind":"shade","inside":"event_b"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"union_rule","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"A\\cup B=\\{\\text{outcomes in }A\\text{ or }B\\text{ or both}\\}"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Does an outcome in the overlap belong to the union?","expected_gist":"Yes. Outcomes in both events are included in the union."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"c6a33f21-dd70-4e2d-b22c-22c3092409bd","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The overlap belongs to the union, but counts only once. Adding the two probabilities counts it twice, so subtract the intersection once.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"overlap_mark","on":"venn","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"both_point","at":[0,0]},{"kind":"segment","from":[0,-1.65],"to":{"at":"both_point"},"arrow":true},{"kind":"text","at":[0,-1.8],"text":"Count once","size":"small"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"probability","anchor":{"el":"union_rule","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B)"}],"checkpoint":null}}
